## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Native impact projection is pending. The current gaps are exact Cedrat, white pepper, Haitian vetiver, sandalwood, Vertofix Coeur grade, and Hedione HC texture. No purchase or automatic integration is authorized. Verify EB's label or receipt before any physical dose. All tinctures and procurement-pending Ambrettolide are excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

After stock-basis, stability, and safety review, compare equal-mass and equal-concentration coded samples in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Use this as the L'Homme family control against each child; keep the code key separately. Liking and similarity are `NOT TESTED`.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

